        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b40282e1de78bdf80c474465de9f823fb9dd4670",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1699437669,
          "type": null,
          "body": "> I really don't care. I'm not a Debian developer and I shouldn't need to be to work on Wireshark.\n\nJoão, you absolutely should care. Balint and I recently disagreed on where Wireshark's Debian packaging should end and Debian's official packaging should begin, but I also recognize that his contributions benefit the larger community and our mission.",
